Indonesia, and Singapore. It operates through the Construction; Property; Utilities; and Investment Holding and Others segments. The company undertakes bulk earthworks, highways and interchanges, bridges, piling and foundation works, utilities, tunnels and underpasses, designs and build works, water infrastructure, and railway mass rapid transit works, as well as constructing commercial, industrial, and residential buildings. It also undertakes civil engineering construction works and boring pile works, as well as owns one mini-hydro power concession and three water concessions. In addition, the company offers hire of plant and machinery; transportation agency; hospital and healthcare services; management consulting services; earthworks; solar power concession services; water and power concession services; management services; and property management and maintenance services. Further, the company is involved in hydropower generation; solar energy collection; and the strike-off process. The company was formerly known as Lai Sing Holdings Berhad and changed its name to Gadang Holdings Berhad in November 1997. Gadang Holdings Berhad was incorporated in 1993 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Gadang Holdings Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，1993 年成立，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，业务覆盖马来西亚、印度尼西亚和新加坡，通过建筑、房地产、公用事业及投资控股等板块运营。","lines":["土木工程与建筑：承接土方工程、公路与立交、桥梁、打桩与基础工程、公用设施、隧道与地下通道、设计与建造工程、水务基础设施及铁路捷运工程，并建造商业、工业和住宅楼宇。","房地产开发：从事物业开发业务。","供水与公用事业：拥有一个小型水电特许权和三个供水特许权，并涉及水力发电、太阳能收集及水与电力特许服务。","机电工程：提供机械与电气工程服务。","其他服务：包括机械租赁、运输代理、医院与医疗保健服务、管理咨询、土方工程、物业管理与维护等。"],"lines_en":["Civil Engineering & Construction: Undertakes bulk earthworks, highways and interchanges, bridges, piling and foundation works, utilities, tunnels and underpasses, design and build works, water infrastructure, and railway mass rapid transit works, as well as constructs commercial, industrial, and residential buildings.","Property Development: Engages in property development.","Water Supply & Utilities: Owns one mini-hydro power concession and three water concessions, and is involved in hydropower generation, solar energy collection, and water and power concession services.","Mechanical & Electrical Engineering: Provides mechanical and electrical engineering services.","Other Services: Includes hire of plant and machinery, transportation agency, hospital and healthcare services, management consulting, earthworks, and property management and maintenance services."]}}